[en.FOCUS_C01_ECONOMIC_POLICY]
Economic Policy

[en.FOCUS_C01_ECONOMIC_POLICY_desc]
The first problem that the New Equestria Empire had to face was how to revive the economy, which was destroyed by the war.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_ECONOMIC_POLICY]
经济政策

[zh.FOCUS_C01_ECONOMIC_POLICY_desc]
战争摧毁了小马国的大部分土地，在战争的废墟上成立起来的小马利亚帝国所需要面对的第一个问题就是如何复兴小马利亚的经济。

